1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,670
You wake up at seven in the morning

2
00:00:01,670 --> 00:00:03,870
and pour yourself a glass of water.

3
00:00:04,030 --> 00:00:05,870
Your roommate walks into the kitchen,

4
00:00:06,310 --> 00:00:07,050
rubs his eyes,

5
00:00:07,370 --> 00:00:07,850
and smiles.

6
00:00:08,530 --> 00:00:08,790
Morning.

7
00:00:09,290 --> 00:00:10,530
Did you sleep well,

8
00:00:10,530 --> 00:00:11,130
he asks.

9
00:00:11,570 --> 00:00:13,270
Yeah, slept like a rock,

10
00:00:13,270 --> 00:00:14,050
you reply.

11
00:00:14,530 --> 00:00:15,770
And right above your lips,

12
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:17,670
a bright crimson box flashes:

13
00:00:18,190 --> 00:00:18,450
Lie.

14
00:00:18,830 --> 00:00:20,430
Rated eighty-four percent.

15
00:00:20,430 --> 00:00:20,990
You freeze.

16
00:00:21,450 --> 00:00:22,770
Your roommate looks at the

17
00:00:22,770 --> 00:00:24,330
breakfast you made and says,

18
00:00:24,570 --> 00:00:26,650
thanks, this tastes amazing.

19
00:00:26,990 --> 00:00:29,350
Floating right above his mouth in bold red letters:

20
00:00:29,350 --> 00:00:29,950
Lie.

21
00:00:30,330 --> 00:00:32,070
He thinks it is cold and bland.
